# Closed and sold out in Russian: закрыто, продано
subtitle: "The museum is closed and the tickets are sold out: read Russian signs with закрыто, открыто, продано, and the forms behind them."
tags: ["russian","russian participles","closed in russian","russian signs","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/participles","reading/reading-signs"]
thumb: "band \"Closed in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Doing two things at once in Russian: читая, прочитав","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/127-russian-gerunds.cast"}

## Closed and sold out in Russian: закрыто, продано
stress: new
level: basic
shuffle: true
heading: false

